er state`"],["de2e0353_09236a9f",54,0,1,"Could you please either remove this class or add tests that use it to this CL?"]],0,448],[7251354,20439,556,10.952,8.912,[[0,0.519,178,297],[1,0.215,180,115],[10,0.178,31,99],[4,0.039,54,21],[30,0.029,8,15],[8,0.01,16,5],[12,0.005,34,2],[9,0.005,5,2]],[["028ca19b_ade525aa",6,-1,1,"Is this the correct bug? It doesn't seems to mention why we need this change."],["2098ecd7_b0f95c30",55,-1,1,"can you register the factory? https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:ios/chrome/browser/profile/model/keyed_service_factories.mm;l=374"],["474166c9_d8556a37",6,-1,0,"I don't quite understand why this is needed as a separate service. I agree with the separation though as sus is very bloated. Is SUS no longer created for users with supervision enabled by android?…"],["e7ade1b7_20112d2c",56,-1,1,"I think we should also update chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc"],["f9dd9e44_3e63ac01",55,-1,1,"can you add a TODO?"],["fb433717_143fd29e",57,-1,1,"Could you reference a bug here to make sure its tracked?"],["3a5e8c32_4cc27407",56,0,1,"nit: per comment on line 212, this should go earlier in the list"]],0,449],[7260485,20439,223,3.919,3.081,[[1,0.756,181,169],[0,0.205,179,46],[10,0.038,32,8]],[["39812fc3_7ef811a0",58,-1,1,"Nit: typo ```suggestion {\"WithSupervisedUserUrlFilter\", true}, ```"],["56425c21_19f408da",58,-1,1,"Nit: typo ```suggestion {\"WithSupervisedUserUrlFilter\", true}, ```"],["9328566f_2469d2dd",58,-1,1,"For simplicity, should we use \"base::test::WithFeatureOverride\" instead? https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:base/test/with_feature_override.h Otherwise, the label should be more…"]],0,450],[7265331,20439,136,3.919,3.081,[[1,0.784,182,110],[0,0.182,180,22],[8,0.034,17,4]],[["1db2b855_e23475b9",6,0,1,"made"]],0,451],[7277818,20445,932,9.596,7.813,[[1,0.678,183,639],[0,0.25,181,229],[12,0.037,35,33],[8,0.031,18,29],[2,0.003,9,2]],[["04f38b20_1ff7e0f4",5,0,0,"What i